cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use jspassgen-sdk-dotnet in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "jspassgen-sdk-dotnet: native .NET port of the jspassgen password generator"
abstract: >-
  A native .NET port of the jspassgen password and passphrase generator
  core, drawing every random value from the platform CSPRNG
  (RandomNumberGenerator) on the caller's machine. Work in progress:
  this version contains the random source only.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
version: "0.0.25"
date-released: 2026-11-21
